	(text_box "U1 is the FA01 (the FA02 was out of stock): it takes the charger's 5 V and waits; the controller sets VSELMIN to\n  15 V (the switch opens below it) and asks for 20 V or 28 V EPR.  Rows stay locked out below 15 V (eFuse UV).\nR7 39 kΩ: VSEL on an FA02 (20 V by itself at power-up), NC on the FA01; kept so that an FA02 drops in.\nThe chip turns the NMOS pair on once a contract is in place and VREQ ≥ VSELMIN, and off on OVP/OCP/UVP/OTP.\nSMAJ30A: 30 V stand-off, above a 28 V EPR contract; the eFuses (60 V) and the TPS26600 OVP (33 V) follow.\nR1 5 mΩ: ISENP and VCC leave from its own sense pads (Kelvin), the AP33772S reads the input current.\nVBUS_SENSE: 100k/10k from VBUS → 2.5 V at 28 V for the ESP32's ADC; also tells the firmware when to enable I2C_PU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 252.73 0)
		(size 240.03 20.32)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "155a742d-f435-562b-9ed6-dd44965069fe")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
